WEBVTT

00:00:07.553 --> 00:00:08.274
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:09.403 --> 00:00:12.347
<v><b>M1:</b></v> That giant rubber duck in the river was a PR stunt.

00:00:14.365 --> 00:00:15.088
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:16.079 --> 00:00:20.942
<v><b>F1:</b></v> An SUV is perfect if you’re looking for a comfortable ride with plenty of space.

00:00:23.304 --> 00:00:24.091
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:25.247 --> 00:00:29.595
<v><b>M2:</b></v> Pennsylvania is said to be one of the top places for UFO sightings.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:32.304
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:33.406 --> 00:00:38.664
<v><b>F2:</b></v> The CEO has called a meeting of all heads of department on Friday morning at 9.00.

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:41.438
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:42.578 --> 00:00:47.017
<v><b>F3:</b></v> You can charge your phone from my laptop – it has a USB port.

00:00:48.869 --> 00:00:49.664
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:50.455 --> 00:00:54.116
<v><b>M3:</b></v> Want to be an astronaut? NASA could be looking for you!

00:00:56.088 --> 00:00:56.917
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:58.066 --> 00:01:02.843
<v><b>F4:</b></v> We’re both rubbish at DIY, so we’re getting someone in to decorate the house.

00:01:04.752 --> 00:01:05.475
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:01:06.547 --> 00:01:10.301
<v><b>M4:</b></v> GDP rose by 0.5% in the last quarter.

00:01:12.757 --> 00:01:13.573
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9

00:01:14.655 --> 00:01:20.140
<v><b>F5:</b></v> The USP of our new batteries is that they last twice as long as all the others on the market.

00:01:22.394 --> 00:01:23.156
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 10

00:01:24.226 --> 00:01:33.828
<v><b>F6:</b></v> Thanks for your email. FYI my name is spelled J-A-N-E, not J-A-Y-N-E